OL,3,GNEWSAFilm studios given permission for
OL,4,Amajor expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic film production facility has
OL,7,Fbeen given the green light to expand.
OL,9,FOn Thursday, Royal Borough of Windsor
OL,10,Fand Maidenhead gave Amazon, the owner
OL,11,Fof Bray Studios, a unanimous permission
OL,12,Fto build six more sound stages at the
OL,13,Fpremises in Windsor.
OL,15,FThe tech giant took over the studios in
OL,16,F2024, after the previous owner had got
OL,17,Fplanning permission to expand them in
OL,18,F2022.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
