OL,3,GNEWSAFilm studios given permission for
OL,4,Amajor expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FKiera Head-Lewis from the Berkshire
OL,7,FFilm Office in Slough, which helps
OL,8,Ffacilitate filming across the county,
OL,9,Fsaid the development also supported
OL,10,Flocal businesses, crew and talent to
OL,11,Ffind jobs in the industry.
